artisans) -> /", "No founding year, ownership, employee count, certifications, equipment, volume, lead time, tolerances stated -> db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Your piece is handbuilt by our artisans in New England.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='green-mountain-tableworx' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Green Muscle Solar operates from Sun City, Arizona, where it was established by co-founders Jim, Brent, Paula, and Jamell. Each founder brought more than 11 years of hands-on solar experience, much of it gained at the nation’s largest solar installer, before launching a company built on a customer-first philosophy.

Installation projects are managed by dedicated project managers rather than commissioned sales representatives, and every install is supervised by a master electrician. Crews handle roof penetration sealing, conduit routing, wiring, and main-panel tie-ins. The service division specializes in troubleshooting and preventative maintenance for systems that are out of warranty, while the consulting arm reviews existing solar contracts and production performance for homeowners who signed with other providers.

Its maintenance work targets older installations that have fallen out of warranty coverage, and its consulting services address customers seeking independent analysis of their current solar agreements. Referrals from satisfied clients form the core of new business.

