UPDATE companies SET description='The business runs an e-commerce platform selling its own branded line of pipe welding tools, including Roll Out Wheels, Pipe Fitting Squares, Roller Heads, and Lathe Chucks, all featuring a zinc-plated finish. Alongside tool sales, the shop accepts custom fabrication projects ranging from custom bus racks to sanitizer stands, advertising that no project is too large or small.

