UPDATE companies SET description='Haas & Sons Electric operates from Millersville, Maryland, as a family-owned and operated electrical service company.

The company provides a full range of residential and commercial electrical services, including repairs, lighting design and installation, electrical panel upgrades (heavy ups), outlet and switch work, troubleshooting, energy efficiency maintenance, EV charger installation, generator installation, landscape and security lighting, ceiling fan installation, circuit breaker and outlet repair, aluminum wiring replacement, whole-house rewiring, and home automation systems. Services are delivered by uniformed, licensed electricians operating from fully stocked trucks equipped with surge protectors, AFCI breakers, dimmer switches, and diagnostic tools. The firm emphasizes OSHA-compliant practices and factory-trained expertise.

Haas & Sons primarily serves homeowners across Maryland, with a focus on Anne Arundel County, as well as commercial clients needing electrical services. Typical projects range from older homes requiring rewiring and fuse box conversions to modern upgrades such as EV charging stations, hot tub wiring, and residential dock electrical systems. The company also performs free home safety inspections with any standard scheduled call, checking GFCI outlets, smoke detectors, and main panels for code violations.

The company states its mission is to deliver prompt, efficient, and expert electrical services that exceed customer expectations, with immediate response for emergency calls. Differentiators cited include upfront pricing without hidden fees, on-time arrival, thorough cleanup with boot-covers, and a five-year warranty on lighting installations. The firm holds BBB accreditation with an A+ rating and has been recognized by BuildZoom as a top 1% Maryland licensed contractor.', certifications=ARRAY['Maryland electrical license','OSHA compliant practices','BBB Accredited Business A+','BuildZoom top 1% Maryland licensed contractors','Angi Approved','Expertise.com 17 Best Washington DC Electricians','Best of Houzz (2018, 2019)','Nextdoor Neighborhood Favorite (2021-2024)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Electrical repairs", "Lighting installation and design", "Electrical panel upgrades (heavy ups)", "Outlet and switch installation and repair", "Troubleshooting and diagnostics", "Energy efficiency maintenance", "EV car charger installation", "Generator installation", "Landscape lighting", "Security lighting systems", "Ceiling fan installation", "Circuit breaker repair", "Electrical outlet repair", "Aluminum wiring replacement", "Whole house rewiring", "Home automation systems", "Commercial electrical services", "Residential electrical services", "Free home safety inspection", "Emergency electrical service"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Energy Efficiency"], "materials": ["Aluminum wiring", "Knob and tube wiring", "AFCI breakers", "GFCI outlets", "Smoke detectors", "Surge protectors", "Dimmer switches", "LED lighting", "Electrical panels", "Breaker boxes", "Subpanels", "EV chargers", "Generators", "Hot tub electrical components", "Residential dock electrical components", "Home automation systems"], "equipment": ["Diagnostic tools"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Immediate response for emergency calls; same-day service available for emergencies", "tolerance