UPDATE companies SET description='Haf Equipment is based in Maplewood, Minnesota.

The company designs and manufactures material handling systems for dry and liquid ingredients. Its product range includes filter receivers, bulk bag unloaders, feeders, pneumatic and mechanical conveyors, blending equipment, dust collectors, air pollution control systems, batching systems, and liquid handling assemblies. Haf offers both off-the-shelf H-Series equipment and customized M-Series tool-free quick take-apart designs. The firm employs 3D modeling for every system and operates a quality control process that inspects every piece before shipment.

Haf serves industries such as food processing, dairy, pharmaceuticals, plastics, chemicals, nutraceuticals, pet food, bakery, snacks, ceramics, steel, batteries, rubber, and air pollution control. Customers range from small plants to large facilities worldwide.

The company emphasizes operator-centric design, innovative solutions for powder and bulk handling, and a team-based quality culture. Its "HAF Difference" values include team focus, humble confidence, elite performance, hustle, and driven yet fun. In 2024, Haf acquired the assets of Semi Bulk Systems to expand into liquid ingredient handling.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Dry ingredient handling system design", "Filter receiver manufacturing", "Systems integration", "Bulk bag unloader manufacturing", "Feeder manufacturing (volumetric, loss-in-weight, gravimetric enrobing)", "Pneumatic conveying (vacuum dilute/dense phase, pressure dilute/dense phase)", "Mechanical conveying (screw conveyor, bucket elevator, incline flex auger)", "Blending equipment (pneumatic blender)", "Dust collection (dry, wet, portable, in-line HEPA)", "Dry sorbent injection", "Air pollution control", "Batching systems", "Liquid handling (liquid tote assembly, liquid tank assembly)", "Process bin activator", "Gravity divert valve", "Vertical mix dryer", "Truck and railcar unloading", "Packaging systems", "Controls integration", "Tool-free quick take-apart equipment design", "3D equipment modeling", "Quality control inspection (fabrication and assembly)", "H-Series off-the-shelf equipment", "M-Series customized equipment"], "industries": ["Food processing", "Dairy", "Pharmaceuticals", "Plastics", "Chemicals", "Nutraceuticals", "Pet food", "Bakery", "Snacks", "Ceramics", "Steel", "Batteries", "Rubber", "Air pollution control"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Filter Receivers (Horizontal Load, Compact Horizontal Load, Top Load, with Loss-in-Weight Feeder)", "Bulk Bag Unloaders (Low Head Height, Forklift Type, Hoist and Trolley, Navigator, Nesting)", "Feeders (Volumetric Tube Feeder, Loss-in-Weight Feeder, Gravimetric Enrobing Feeder)", "Pneumatic Conveyors (Vacuum Dilute Phase, Vacuum Dense Phase, Pressure Dilute Phase, Pressure Dense Phase)", "Mechanical Conveyors (