UPDATE companies SET description='Happy''s Gifts and Apparel operates from Hazen, North Dakota, in Mercer County. The business was started about five years ago by Keith and Morgan, a husband-and-wife team who moved from nearby Washburn to be closer to their growing customer base. Keith, a paramedic with over a decade of experience, and Morgan run the shop as a Christian, family-owned, home-based operation.

The company provides custom embroidery, laser engraving and cutting, branded apparel (t-shirts, polos, hats), insulated stainless-steel tumblers, and a range of promotional products such as keychains, coozies, awards, and magnets. They work with materials including wood, leather, acrylic, and fabric, using a laser engraver and an embroidery machine. The shop handles orders from small batches to wholesale volumes of 10–100+ pieces, offering free design proofs and bulk pricing.

Happy''s serves local businesses and organizations across Mercer County, including oil field crews, schools, churches, farms, and event organizers in Hazen, Beulah, Stanton, and surrounding communities. They produce embroidered uniforms for work teams, laser-engraved awards for events, custom tumblers for client gifts, and branded apparel for employee recognition and tradeshows.

The founders emphasize a personal, hands-on approach—customers work directly with the people making the products—and a commitment to keeping dollars in the community. They position themselves as a one-stop local alternative to out-of-state online vendors, offering fast turnaround, local pickup, and wholesale rates with flexible minimums.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom embroidery", "Laser engraving and cutting", "Branded apparel (screen printing and embroidery)", "Custom tumblers and drinkware", "Promotional products and swag", "Custom awards and signage", "Personalized gifts and keepsakes"], "industries": ["Oil and gas", "Education", "Religious organizations", "Agriculture", "Events and tradeshows", "Corporate branding and employee recognition"], "materials": ["Wood", "Leather", "Acrylic", "Stainless steel", "Fabric"], "equipment": ["Laser engraver", "Embroidery machine", "Miter saw"], "volume": "10\u2013100+ pieces", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned, home-based shop with direct owner involvement", "Free design proofs and consultations", "Low minimums and wholesale pricing on bulk orders (10\u2013100+ pieces)", "Fast local turnaround with pickup in Hazen, ND", "One-stop shop for embroidery, laser engraving, apparel, tumblers, and promotional products"], "facts_used": ["Location: Hazen, ND (Mercer County) -> /", "Founders: Keith and Morgan -> /about", "Founded about 5 years ago, started with miter saw then laser engraver and embroidery machine -> /about", "Family-owned, Christian, home-based shop -> /about", "Keith paramedic for 10+ years -> /about", "Services: custom embroidery, laser engraving/cutting, branded apparel, tumblers, promotional products -> /", "Materials: wood, leather, acrylic, stainless steel, fabric -> /", "Industries served: oil field crews, schools, churches, farms, events -> /", "Bulk wholesale pricing, low minimums, 10\u2013100+ pieces -> /", "Free design proofs, fast local turna