UPDATE companies SET description='Harrell''s Metal Works, Inc. is a family-owned structural steel fabricator based in Grenada, Mississippi. The company was founded in 1985 by Randy Harrell to serve the ornamental iron and miscellaneous metal industries. Initially operating as a full-service structural fabrication firm specializing in subcontracted work, the business expanded under Harrell''s leadership into a significant structural steel fabricator.

Today, Harrell''s Metal Works provides fabricated structural steel for a range of projects, emphasizing consistent, reliable, and cost-effective services. The company operates with a team of dedicated employees, though specific facility size and headcount are not publicly disclosed.

The firm serves customers in the ornamental iron, miscellaneous metal, and structural steel sectors, primarily performing subcontracted fabrication for other contractors and project owners.

