UPDATE companies SET description='Herb Sheet Metal Inc. was founded in 1952 in Lebanon, Pennsylvania, when Frank Herb and his sons Jack and Ray purchased the David High Metal Shop at 317 S. 6th St. for $6,000. The company has remained in the Herb family through four generations; Jack Herb Sr. led the firm until his death in 1996, followed by Jack Herb Jr., who retired in 2023 and passed ownership to his son Steve Herb Sr.

The shop produces custom metal and fiberglass duct board for commercial and residential HVAC systems. Fiberglass duct board is supplied flat or pre‑assembled in three thicknesses. The company also provides on‑site measurement, duct layout design, installation, and duct leakage testing.

