UPDATE companies SET description='Hess Equipment Solutions is based in St. Louis, Missouri. The company traces its roots to 1946 when Earl Hess began selling Berkel slicers and scales from a van. The business, originally known as Hess Meat Machines, was formally established in 1950 and expanded to a shop and warehouse on Gravois Avenue by 1961. In 2022, Rachel Herren became sole owner, and the firm earned national certification as a Women’s Business Enterprise through the Women’s Business Enterprise National Council (WBENC). It remains family‑owned and woman‑led.

Today Hess operates as a distributor and service provider for commercial kitchen and food‑processing equipment. Its product portfolio includes cooking, baking, smoking, weighing, labeling, and frozen‑dessert systems from brands such as Berkel, Southern Pride, Carpigiani, Mettler Toledo, Henny Penny, Hollymatic, Fri‑Jado, and Jaccard. The company also offers equipment repair, preventative‑maintenance plans, 24/7 emergency service, consulting, and training programs. It serves customers across Nebraska, Kansas, southern Illinois, Missouri, and Iowa.

Hess targets food‑retail, food‑service, and food‑processing operations. Its client base includes supermarket chains, butcher shops, convenience stores, restaurants, caterers, and other institutional kitchens. The firm points to long‑standing partnerships with manufacturers — such as a 40‑year run as a top‑10 Berkel distributor and a Henny Penny Service Excellence Award in 2020 — as evidence of its industry standing.

The company says its founding mission was to replace hand tools with reliable equipment, and its current differentiation rests on a combination of deep product knowledge, round‑the‑clock technical support, and a partnership model that aims to reduce downtime and improve bottom‑line results for food‑service operators.', certifications=ARRAY['WBENC','Women''s Business Enterprise (WBE)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Equipment sales and distribution", "Equipment repair and maintenance", "Preventative maintenance plans", "24/7 emergency repair service", "Consulting for food service operations", "Training programs for equipment operation", "Scale and wrapper solutions"], "industries": ["Food retail", "Food service", "Food processing"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Berkel slicers and scales", "Southern Pride smokers", "Carpigiani frozen dessert machines", "Mettler Toledo scales", "Henny Penny combi ovens and fryers", "Hollymatic mixer grinders and portioners", "Fri-Jado modular counters", "Jaccard gravity slicer"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["24/7 on-call technical support", "Preventative maintenance plans", "WBENC\u2011certified woman\u2011owned business", "Family\u2011owned since 1946", "Top 10 Berkel distributor for 40 years"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1946 by Earl Hess selling Berkel slicers from a van -> /about-us", "Formally started Hess Meat Machines in 1950 -> /about-us", "WBENC certified woman-owned in 2022 -> /about-us", "Rebranded to Hess Equipment Solutions in 2024 -> /about-us", "Headquarters St. Louis, Missouri -> db", "Serves Nebraska, Kansas, Southern Illinois, Missouri, Iowa -> /", "Industries: food retail, food service, food processing -> /about-us", "Customer types: supermarket chains, butcher shops, convenience stores, restaurants, caterers -> /about-us", "Brands: Berkel, Southern Pride, Carpigiani, Mettler Toledo, Henny Penny, Hollymatic, Fri-Jado, Jaccard -> /", "Services: equipment sales, repair, preventat