UPDATE companies SET description='Hi-Tech Mold & Engineering, operating as Hi-Tech Mold Carolina, is a family-owned and operated business based in Westminster, South Carolina. The company serves as a full-service supplier for the plastics and tooling industries, with a technology center that performs mold tryouts and validation using advanced molding processes.

The company provides plastic injection molded components, value-added assembly, and product design and development. Its capabilities span 5-axis CNC machining, additive manufacturing, EDM, benching and polishing, tool assembly, and a CMM laboratory. The Tech Center runs fully automated equipment for core back and coining, injection-compression, gas assist, insert molding, low pressure molding, and Smartfoil molding, with in-house tooling support for all tryouts and mold validation.

Hi-Tech Mold Carolina serves automotive, defense, medical device, electric vehicle, aerospace, appliance, ATV, and recreational vehicle markets. The company maintains strategic alliances with global partners to offer single-point management for major programs, from small tool packages to entire vehicle platforms.

The company emphasizes a ''First Time, On Time, Every Time'' philosophy, positioning itself as an industry leader that executes challenging programs through continuous innovation. Its quality system is certified to ISO 9001:2015, IATF 16949, and AS9100D.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','IATF 16949','AS9100D']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["5-axis CNC machining", "Additive manufacturing (3D printing)", "Plastic injection molding", "Value-added assembly", "Product design and development", "Program management", "Engineered solutions", "EDM", "Benching and polishing", "Tool assembly", "CMM laboratory", "Mold tryouts and validation", "Core back and coining technologies", "Injection-compression molding", "Gas assist molding", "Insert molding", "Low pressure molding", "Smartfoil molding", "24-hour service and repairs"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Defense", "Medical devices", "Electric vehicles", "Aerospace", "Appliances", "ATVs", "Recreational vehicles", "Plastics industry", "Tooling industry"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned and operated", "In-house tooling support for all tryouts and mold validation", "Fully automated equipment with modern control systems", "Strategic alliances with global partners for single-point program management", "24-hour service and repairs"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Westminster, South Carolina -> db", "Family-owned and operated -> /", "Certifications: ISO 9001:2015, IATF 16949, AS9100D -> /", "Industries served: Automotive, Defense, Medical Devices, Electric Vehicles, Aerospace, Appliances, ATVs, Recreational Vehicles -> /", "Capabilities: 5-axis CNC machining, additive manufacturing, plastic injection molding, value-added assembly, product design, program management, EDM, benching/polishing, tool assembly, CMM lab, mold tryouts/validation, various molding processes -> /, /capabilities", "Tech Center with in-house tooling support and fully automat