e crystal conversion -> /quality", "Uses photoluminescence for donor/acceptor detection at ppt level -> /quality", "Uses ICP-MS for metallic impurity analysis at ppt level -> /quality", "Uses GC, FTIR, ICP-AES, ICP-MS for saline product analysis -> /quality", "Certified to ISO 9001:2015 and ISO 14001:2015 -> /quality", "Serves semiconductor and fiber optic industries -> /quality"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "The polycrystalline silicon produced in our factory''s reduction furnaces is sampled and analyzed to ensure the highest possible purity.", "founded_year": "1996", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='high-purity-silicon-america-corporation' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
