UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Raleigh, North Carolina, Holman Wholesale Parts & Delivery operates as the wholesale division of the Holman Automotive Group, a multi-generational automotive retailer in the Southeast. The wholesale arm extends the group''s dealership infrastructure to the aftermarket, supplying genuine OEM parts and accessories to body shops, collision centers, and repair facilities across North Carolina, South Carolina, and southern Virginia.

The distributor maintains an inventory valued at more than $10 million, covering 22 vehicle brands from luxury and performance lines to hybrids and commercial models. A network of over 30 dealerships feeds the supply chain, while factory-trained and certified parts personnel provide technical support for identification and sourcing. An in-house delivery fleet offers free next-day service throughout the three-state territory.

