UPDATE companies SET description='Holsen Solar was founded in 2018 in Fargo, North Dakota, by Ben Holsen, who drew on a background in entrepreneurship and technology to establish a full-service electrical contracting and solar company. The business remains headquartered in Fargo and operates as a licensed electrical and building contractor serving eastern North Dakota and western Minnesota.

The company designs, permits, installs, and warranties all projects in-house without subcontractors. Its services include rooftop, ground-mount, pole-mount, and tracking solar arrays; Level 2 EV charger installations; permanent architectural LED lighting (Gemstone residential and Haven commercial); battery backup systems using Tesla Powerwall, Franklin WH, and EG4 units; and energy management via Span smart panels and Emporia monitoring. As of the latest figures, the firm has completed over 200 projects and employs a team of 16 licensed electricians and certified installers.

Holsen Solar serves residential homeowners, farmers, small businesses, municipalities, and apartment developers across its service area. Commercial solar work is available statewide in both North Dakota and Minnesota. Recent projects include a 25 kW commercial rooftop system in Fargo, a full-roof commercial array on a metal building in Moorhead, and a complex three-story residential Gemstone lighting installation in Pelican Rapids, Minnesota.

The company emphasizes that the people who sell a system are the same people who install and service it. Its stated differentiators include holding master electrical and contractor licenses in both states, performing all work under its own permits, providing transparent pricing with detailed breakdowns, guaranteeing on-time completion, and offering a comprehensive in-house labor and materials warranty backed by manufacturer warranties. Local knowledge of utilities, cooperatives, inspectors, and weather conditions is cited as a key advantage.', certifications=ARRAY['ULLISTED','Energy Star Certified Installer','Tesla Certified','Span Panel Certified','Gemstone Certified','EV Charger Certified','PVIP Certified']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar energy system design and installation", "EV charger installation (Level 2)", "Permanent architectural LED lighting installation (Gemstone)", "Commercial architectural lighting installation (Haven)", "Energy storage system installation (Tesla Powerwall, Franklin WH, EG4)", "Energy management system installation (Span smart panels, Emporia monitoring)", "Electrical permitting and inspection", "Master electrical contracting", "Building contracting", "Pre-wiring for new construction", "Emergency electrical service for existing customers"], "industries": ["Residential solar", "Commercial solar", "Agricultural solar", "Municipal solar", "EV charging infrastructure", "Permanent architectural lighting", "Commercial architectural lighting", "Energy storage", "Energy management", "Electrical contracting", "Building contracting"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Tesla Powerwall", "Franklin WH", "EG4", "Span smart panels", "Emporia monitoring", "Gemstone lighting system", "Haven lighting system", "Level 2 EV chargers"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["No subcontractors \u2014 all work performed in-house", "Master electrician licensed in North Dakota and Minnesota", "Fully permitted and inspected on e