UPDATE companies SET description='Honest Components, Inc. is based in Tampa, Florida, and operates as a woman-owned small business certified by the U.S. Small Business Administration. The company is led by President Jackie Schwab, who brings over 30 years of sales leadership in the electronic components industry. Founded on the principle that honesty and integrity create lasting partnerships, the business focuses on supplying obsolete and hard-to-find board-level electronic components to customers where reliability is essential.

The company maintains a line card of over 50,000 board-level components from manufacturers such as AMD, Intel, and Texas Instruments, covering connectors, capacitors, microcontrollers, and memory chips. Honest Components provides sourcing, procurement, and testing services, leveraging a global network of vetted suppliers. Every order undergoes third-party authentication at independent laboratories accredited to ISO/IEC 17025:2017 and AS6171, including visual inspection, X-ray imaging, decapsulation, solderability, and functional testing. The firm reports more than 200,000 authentic components supplied and over 50 combined years of industry experience among its team.

Honest Components serves aerospace, defense, medical, healthcare, and industrial sectors, supporting OEMs, contract manufacturers, and government contractors. As an ITAR-registered entity and a member of the Government-Industry Data Exchange Program (GIDEP), the company is authorized to manage U.S. defense-related components and actively combats counterfeit parts in the supply chain.

The company differentiates itself by bearing the cost of independent third-party testing on every order, backing shipments with a 90-day form-fit-function guarantee, and maintaining certifications including ISO 9001:2015, AS9120B, and WOSB status. Its mission centers on transparency, risk-based quality processes, and enabling customers to maintain production schedules and extend the life of legacy systems.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','AS9120B','ITAR Registered','GIDEP Membership','WOSB (Women-Owned Small Business)','Better Business Bureau Accredited']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Sourcing of obsolete and hard-to-find electronic components", "Procurement and vendor management", "Third-party component testing (visual inspection, X-ray, decapsulation, solderability, functional testing)", "Last-time buy guidance and alternative sourcing", "Export compliance and international trade management"], "industries": ["Aerospace", "Defense", "Medical", "Healthcare", "Industrial"], "materials": ["Board-level electronic components", "Connectors", "Capacitors", "Microcontrollers", "Memory chips"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Small, medium, and high-volume requirements", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Independent third-party testing at no additional cost on every order", "90-day Form, Fit, and Function Guarantee", "Woman-Owned Small Business (WOSB) certified for supplier diversity", "ITAR registered for defense-related components", "GIDEP member actively combating counterfeit parts"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Tampa, Florida -> /about-us", "Woman-owned small business (WOSB) certified by SBA -> /about-us, /", "President Jackie Schwab with 30+ years experience -> /about-us", "Over 50,000 board-level components in line card from AMD, Intel, Texas Instruments -> /", "More than 200,000 authentic components supplied -> /", "50+ combined years electronics experience -> /about-us", "ISO 9001:2015 & AS9120B certified -> /", "ITAR Registered -> /", "