UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1976 in Orangeburg, South Carolina, IPS Packaging & Automation operates as a certified service-disabled veteran-owned business with a nationwide distribution network. The company began as a packaging supplies provider and has expanded over five decades to offer equipment, automation, and engineering services across the United States.

