UPDATE companies SET description='Idaho Milk Products operates from Jerome, Idaho, in the heart of the Magic Valley. The company recently commissioned a new ice cream and blending facility, expanding its existing dairy ingredient operations. No founding year or founders are disclosed in public materials.

