UPDATE companies SET description='Image One operates from Little Rock, Arkansas. The company has been developing apparel for over 30 years, though a specific founding year is not publicly stated.

The company creates hyperlocal graphics that honor the history and traditions of colleges, universities, resorts, camps, and military organizations. Its product lines include custom apparel, stickers laminated with a scratch‑resistant textured matte finish, canvas prints, wood blocks, photo frames, coasters, and ornaments. No facility size, headcount, or annual volume figures are published.

